  "description": "We protected capital for 62 days. Now every signal has triggered to go stock shopping!",
  "body_html": "<p>Since February 12th, we have done nothing. The market was going down, and we do not throw capital at markets that are not working for us. <em><strong>By avoiding weak price action, we prevent ourselves from potentially experiencing horrific price action (ie potential bear markets).</strong></em> </p><p>I have 2 jobs here, for you all:</p><ol><li><p>We make money</p></li><li><p>We protect money ← This is what we were doing. That time is ending.</p></li></ol><p>Last week, you received notification that <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-is-back?r=4z8lgl\">The Stock Market is BACK!</a> and to prepare yourself for some buy signals, should the market hold up through the weekend. We had a rough start on Monday…only for the market to immediately gobble up the drop and move upwards, higher. </p><p>Our key requirements that I detailed on March 20th, <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/when-will-the-stock-market-pain-end\">When to buy again</a> have been met:</p><ol><li><p>VIX below 21 ✅</p></li><li><p>S&amp;P 500 reclaim 200 day moving average and reclaim lost price action ground ✅</p></li><li><p>A sector breaks out. <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/p-193622355?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Avis breaking out</a> was a signal of this. ✅</p></li></ol><p>Yesterday and today, I have spent most of my time pondering WHAT to buy. These 2 stocks, we are not hearing anyone talk about, which is awesome, we want to be selling off when you start seeing the chatter on TikTok and Substack. Finally, after 62 days of observation, here is my decision for 2 stocks that literally gapped up from the bottom: </p>",
